OL,3,AFour years after huge asteroid crash, a
OL,4,Aspacecraft has now returned to assess
OL,5,Athe damage
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe asteroid poses no threat, instead
OL,8,Fthis was the first ever test of our
OL,9,Fplanetary defences to see what action
OL,10,Fwe could take if a space rock was
OL,11,Fheading for our planet.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
