OL,3,AKilmar Abrego Garcia leaves US for
OL,4,ASpain, ending Trump deportation battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FKilmar Abrego Garcia, whose deportation
OL,7,Flast year to El Salvador sparked a
OL,8,Fbitter deportation battle, has left the
OL,9,FUS for Spain.
OL,11,FHe took a commercial flight to the
OL,12,Fcountry on Tuesday.
OL,14,FAfter the government admitted it had
OL,15,Fwrongfully sent Abrego Garcia to his
OL,16,Fhome country, he was returned to the US
OL,17,Fto face human trafficking charges,
OL,18,Fwhich were later dropped. The
OL,19,Fadministration then continued its
OL,20,Fattempts to send him to other
OL,21,Fcountries, including Uganda and Ghana.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
